docs {
  # Create Patient

  새 환자를 생성합니다.

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | dicomPatientId | string | **Yes** | DICOM Patient ID |
  | issuerOfPatientId | string | No | Patient ID 발급 기관 |
  | patientName | string | No | 환자 이름 |
  | patientBirthDate | string | No | 생년월일 (YYYY-MM-DD) |
  | patientSex | string | No | 성별 (M: 남성, F: 여성, O: 기타) |
  | emrPatientId | string | No | EMR 환자 ID |

  ## Request Example

  ```json
  {
    "dicomPatientId": "PAT001",
    "issuerOfPatientId": "HOSPITAL_A",
    "patientName": "Hong Gildong",
    "patientBirthDate": "1990-01-15",
    "patientSex": "M",
    "emrPatientId": "EMR001"
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 201000,
    "message": "Created",
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "uuid": "01936b6c-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc",
      "dicomPatientId": "PAT001",
      "issuerOfPatientId": "HOSPITAL_A",
      "issuerTypeCode": null,
      "patientName": "Hong Gildong",
      "patientBirthDate": "1990-01-15",
      "patientSex": "M",
      "emrPatientId": "EMR001",
      "matchingConfidence": null,
      "matchingStatus": null,
      "studiesCount": 0,
      "lastStudyDate": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "tenantId": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error (400) - Validation Error
  ```json
  {
    "code": 400000,
    "message": "Validation failed",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
